WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:05.310
Most of the modern world operates from a system
of individualism.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:11.750
A system that puts the fate of the individual
in the hands of the individual.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:17.430
If you are successful, it is because you worked
hard and smart and you deserve it.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:22.370
If you are a failure, it is because you didn’t
and you deserve it.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:27.150
This system of thought and reasoning is widely
endorsed by many of the world’s leading

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.150
cultures.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:34.200
It is the basis of capitalism and arguably
the basis of human nature.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.200
It is the reason why we try.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.050
Why we apply creativity.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:43.940
Why we compete to progress humankind.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:47.930
Because we believe that our actions determine
our fate.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:52.820
That we all control the course of our own
lives.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:58.079
But this begs the question, how in control
are we really?

00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:05.619
How much stake should we place in the ideal
that we are the sole driver of our life?

00:01:05.619 --> 00:01:12.030
It appears to be true that we humans do have
some ability to influence the direction in

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.470
which our life goes.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:21.490
Hard work, strategy, and ingenuity can increase
the likeliness of achieving one’s goals

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:24.990
and desired lifestyle.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:30.850
But it also appears to be true that often
times what we want does not align with what

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:32.430
we get.

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:38.360
That life operates on its own wavelength,
some amount out of reach from our volition

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.270
and control.

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:45.150
Fundamentally, we live in a reality that we
do not fully understand.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:52.780
And as a result, there is an entire realm
of uncertainty and arbitrariness associated

00:01:52.780 --> 00:02:00.530
with everything we experience, including our
fortunes and misfortunes.

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:03.770
We are not the sole pilots of our life.

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.610
We cannot choose whom we are born to.

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:08.610
Or to avoid a tragedy.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:14.180
Or to be tall or small, white or black, dumb
or smart.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:20.719
We are all forced to submit to our DNA and
the instances of luck or tragedy that we are

00:02:20.719 --> 00:02:23.989
exposed to in life.

00:02:23.989 --> 00:02:26.689
The truth is, things happen.

00:02:26.689 --> 00:02:28.989
For good and for bad.

00:02:28.989 --> 00:02:34.519
But oftentimes things that happen, happen
just because they happen.

00:02:34.519 --> 00:02:39.109
Not because of intent, but because of chance.

00:02:39.109 --> 00:02:44.340
And the things that happen out of chance hold
the same amount of weight and influence on

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:49.049
our lives as the things that happen out of
intent.

00:02:49.049 --> 00:02:56.150
Humanity may operate out of individuality,
but the universe operates from a place of

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.150
collectivity.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:03.519
And so we must learn how to live with the
burden of existing with an individualistic

00:03:03.519 --> 00:03:11.010
mind and culture, while simultaneously existing
within a collective reality.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:15.870
We should try to do everything in our power
to influence our life.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:22.749
We should feel motivated and invigorated to
work towards goals and success.

00:03:22.749 --> 00:03:28.430
But we should also acknowledge the realm of
life that is beyond our control, so we can

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:35.430
be reasonably indifferent towards the fortunes
and misfortunes we experience so we do not

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:42.469
become disillusioned if our fate does not
align with our intentions or become inflated

00:03:42.469 --> 00:03:45.730
with narcissism if it does.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:48.760
It is not only our achievements that matter.

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:56.329
Wealthy or poor, smart or foolish, famous
or unknown, we all remain in the same boat,

00:03:56.329 --> 00:04:00.609
just as confused and as vulnerable to life
as the next.

00:04:00.609 --> 00:04:07.849
Our quality of life depends on our ability
to admit this, roll with the punches, and

00:04:07.849 --> 00:04:12.959
stay inspired to pursue success for the mere
sake of the pursuit.

00:04:12.959 --> 00:04:20.989
To function partly as an observer of our own
life, whose primary objective is to be entertained

00:04:20.989 --> 00:04:38.759
by life’s uncertainty, for both the good

00:04:38.759 --> 00:04:50.080
and 

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.189
the bad.

